WEBVTT

00:02:58.204 --> 00:03:01.579
so they are more sensitive
to stress during their lifetime.

00:03:01.663 --> 00:03:04.371
These changes 
are considered epigenetic,

00:03:04.413 --> 00:03:07.454
which means they can
affect which genes are expressed

00:03:07.496 --> 00:03:10.204
without directly changing
the genetic code.

00:03:10.704 --> 00:03:14.663
All of these changes can be reversed
if the mothers are exchanged.

00:03:14.913 --> 00:03:16.663
But there is an astonishing result.

00:03:16.704 --> 00:03:19.746
The epigenetic changes
caused by only one mother rat

00:03:19.788 --> 00:03:22.829
were passed on to several
generations of rats after her.

00:03:22.871 --> 00:03:26.621
In other words, the results
of these actions were hereditary.

00:03:26.829 --> 00:03:29.288
It is not all bad news, however.

00:03:29.913 --> 00:03:33.996
The effects of cortisol on the brain
can be reversed in several ways.